    <mxCell id="note" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#5D6D7E;&quot;&gt;SAGEConv：采用采样+聚合策略，将邻居特征与自身特征拼接后做线性变换，适合大规模图和归纳学习场景&lt;br&gt;公式：h_N(v) = mean({h_u, ∀u∈N(v)}) · h_v' = W · CONCAT(h_v, h_N(v))&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=rect;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BDC3C7;strokeWidth=1;rounded=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=10;">
